                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This afternoon, I was honored to receive the MITRE Health Defender of the Year Award from the John P. Mayhugh Foundation (@JPM_Foundation), a nonprofit dedicated to preserving John Powell Mayhugh\u2019s legacy.\n\nI had the privilege of meeting with Mary Lowe Mayhugh and Rhys O\u2019Neill to discuss their mission of raising awareness for Post-Traumatic Stress (PTS), Traumatic Brain Injury (TBI), and other brain and behavioral health challenges in the military community, and the full range of therapies and treatments that support our service members.",
                "text_lang": "en",
