                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Wishing my Jewish friends in #NJ07, and all who observe around the world, a joyful beginning to Rosh Hashanah tonight. May this new year bring you good health, happiness, and prosperity. \n\nShanah Tovah! https://t.co/2UE6Qie6jx",
