                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Patrick the pit bull lived an extraordinary and impactful life.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nOver a decade ago, Patrick endured horrific abuse where he was starved, emaciated, and discarded down a trash chute. After being nursed back to health, this resilient pup went on to live another 15 years and leaves behind a tremendous legacy for animal welfare.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nHis miraculous story inspired 'Patrick's Law,' legislation I sponsored in the New Jersey State Senate to strengthen penalties for animal cruelty and protect countless other animals from suffering.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nRest in Peace, Miracle Dog \ud83d\udc3e",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1758561612,
                "view_count": 473
