                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I recently toured @microsomerset, a medical device manufacturer that has been doing business for more than 80 years in New Jersey.\n\nAs a global supplier, MICRO provides end-to-end medical device products and solutions that help to improve health outcomes for patients around the world. Recent provisions in the Working Families Tax Cut will benefit companies like MICRO by allowing 100% expensing on domestic R&D, as well as new factories, equipment, and machinery. \n\nThank you to the team at MICRO for the informative tour and for your contributions to medical device manufacturing and innovation.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
