                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Starting today, veterans traveling to the Lyons VA Medical Center will now have access to a fare-free shuttle from the Lyons Train Station in Bernards Township. \n\nI was honored to join the kick-off ceremony yesterday launching this critical new service for veterans. This milestone demonstrates what we can achieve when we work together across all levels of government. On the federal level, I am pleased to build on this progress by introducing new legislation to ensure this service remains a sustained, long-term solution.\n\nWith Veterans Day just around the corner, this launch could not be more timely \u2014 it will improve lives, ease burdens, and honor those who have served our nation.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1762549123,
                "view_count": 740
