                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I recently toured Mira Vie at Green Knoll with Bridgewater Councilman Michael Kirsch and representatives from the American Seniors Housing Association (ASHA), the Health Care Association of New Jersey (HCANJ), and Distinctive Living.\n\nMira Vie is helping seniors across New Jersey live longer, healthier, and more fulfilling lives. With independent and assisted living options, along with memory and respite care programs, their team is making a meaningful difference for older adults and their families.\u00a0\n\nThank you to the Mira Vie staff, as well as ASHA, @HCANJ, and @distinctivelvg for the informative discussion.",
