                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I appreciated meeting with Dr. Jessica Israel, EVP and Chief Medical Officer at Complete Care. Their five long-term care facilities in our district provide 24/7 compassionate care to New Jerseyans. \n\nWe discussed federal support for long-term care and ways to ensure providers can continue delivering high-quality and specialized support for seniors and families.",
