                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Exciting news for Mount Olive Township! Yesterday, my team joined Mayor Joe Nicastro and Council members to break ground on the new Mount Olive Health Center. \n\nThis facility will serve as a central hub for the Township\u2019s Health Department, Health Clinic, Public Access, and Social Services. It\u2019s great to see federal funding go towards expanding access to essential health and wellness services for this community.",
