                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Insurers & PBMs shouldn\u2019t be allowed to pocket co-pay assistance without counting it toward a patient\u2019s costs. \n\nI introduced the HELP Copays Act to fix this and ensure savings for critical prescriptions medications are actually passed down to Americans.\n\nhttps://t.co/uKkhadca08 https://t.co/WowjnW8qKz",
