                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I had a great meeting today with Hadassah, the Women\u2019s Zionist Organization of America. We discussed how we can work together to combat antisemitism in all its forms, including in medical settings. It is critical that members of the Jewish community receive care with the same quality, dignity, and respect as anyone else. \n\nWe also spoke about the incredible innovation coming out of Hadassah\u2019s hospitals in Jerusalem and the importance of a strong U.S.-Israel partnership. Thank you to @Hadassah for your continued advocacy and partnership.",
